Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,iATC · Aircraft and towers coordinate through Agent Relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Monterey has both runways closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,JRE45 is headed for San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Deterministic agent decisions · Terse durable actors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A tap on the phone controller triggers smoke on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayday. Find a runway before the emergency deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Monterey refuses: both runways are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,San José confirms a diversion. 2.6 seconds after the smoke command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Every coordination message travels over Agent Relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump cut · +78 seconds · Cleared for San José
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,JRE45 has landed at San José.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,New York: close JFK for weather from the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,JFK arrivals negotiate new landing slots at nearby airports.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump cut · +164 seconds · The diverted flights arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aircraft are simulated. Relay messages and durable state are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For airports and airline teams rehearsing a bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mohammed Wasif · Siddharth Surana\NBuilt on Terse + Agent Relay · github.com/mohltbot/airport-coordination
